  "question": {
    "text": "A ball of mass <math><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> is moving with velocity 3<math><mi>v</mi></math>. It collides head on elastically with a stationary ball of mass <math><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>. The velocity of both the balls become <math><mi>v</mi></math> after collision. Then the value of the ratio <math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math> is"
  },
